# Pip's first dive comes home — and the compass.
@id pip_first_return
@title Gerald
@trigger first_return
@order 20

== start
pip (happy): I'M BACK! Look! Seven mushrooms, and only one of them bit me!
maro (surprised): Mushrooms don't bite.
pip (neutral): Down there they do. Also, I named the big rat Gerald. Gerald is my nemesis now.
* "Amazing haul, Pip!"
  ~ affinity pip +1
  pip (happy): Right?! Gerald won't know what hit him tomorrow.
* "You came back bitten. Rest first."
  ~ affinity maro +1
  pip (sad): Fiiine.
  maro (happy): Hm. Good boss.
* "What's that brass thing on your belt?"
  ~ flag knows_wren
  -> compass
narrator: Maro takes the mushrooms. Something in the pot starts to smell like home.
-> end

== compass
pip (neutral): Oh — this? It's a compass. It was Mum's.
pip (sad): Wren the Cartographer. She mapped half the Hollow. Then she went down to the Orchard and… didn't come back up.
maro (sad): …
pip (happy): The needle never points north. It points down. I think it's pointing at her.
pip (neutral): Anyway! Mushrooms! Soup! Go go go!
narrator: Maro takes the mushrooms. He doesn't say anything for a long time.
-> end
